          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Philosophy.png",
            "heading": "OUR PHILOSOPHY",
            "body": "<p>We believe beautiful jewellery shouldn’t be reserved only for special occasions. It should be something you can reach for every day — a little expression of your style, your confidence and the way you choose to present yourself to the world.</p><p>At ALLMIGHTY, our collections are thoughtfully curated to bring together <strong>elegance, versatility and effortless wearability</strong>. From delicate pieces that add a subtle touch of shine to your everyday look, to more expressive designs made for celebrations and memorable moments, we aim to offer jewellery that feels at home in every part of your life.</p><p>We look beyond just how a piece appears. We consider how beautifully it can complement different styles, how easily it can become part of your wardrobe, and whether it carries that special quality that makes you want to wear it again and again.</p><p>Every piece is selected with one simple thought in mind: <strong>would we be proud to make this a part of your jewellery collection?</strong> Because we don’t simply want to offer jewellery that looks beautiful — we want to offer pieces that feel worth choosing, wearing and making a part of your story.</p>",
            "layout": "image_first"
          }
        },
        "iwt2": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Promise.png",
            "heading": "OUR PROMISE",
            "body": "<p>What you see should be what you can genuinely look forward to receiving. We believe trust begins with being clear, consistent and thoughtful at every step — from the moment you discover a piece you love to the moment it arrives in your hands.</p><p>At ALLMIGHTY, we take care in selecting jewellery that reflects the beauty, style and character we want our collections to represent. Every design is thoughtfully considered for its appearance, finish and overall appeal, so that the pieces we offer are ones we would be happy to choose for ourselves and the people we love.</p><p>But our commitment goes beyond the jewellery itself. From how our products are presented on our website to the way your order is carefully prepared, packaged and delivered, we want every interaction with ALLMIGHTY to feel <strong>considered, transparent and dependable</strong>.</p><p>We understand that shopping for jewellery online comes with an important expectation — <strong>confidence in what you are choosing and trust in the brand you are choosing it from.</strong> That is why we strive to communicate clearly, present our collections thoughtfully and be there for our customers whenever support is needed.</p><p>For us, your purchase is not simply another order. It is an opportunity to build a relationship that lasts beyond a single piece of jewellery. Because while beautiful jewellery may bring you to ALLMIGHTY, we hope it is the <strong>care, consistency and trust behind your experience</strong> that makes you want to return.</p>",
